{"id":"f1fbcbda19c71980","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Regular Space","display":"df-zfc-top5-regular-space — ZFC Top5 Regular Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-regular-space — ZFC Top5 Regular Space","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-regular-space — ZFC Top5 Regular Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,x,F,U,V\">\\(X,\\tau,x,F,U,V\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (拓扑空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\)</span> (open set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (closed set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5RegularSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5RegularSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}regular\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5RegularSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;((\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\land x\\notin F)\\to\\exists U,V\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,V)\\land x\\in U\\land F\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}regular\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5RegularSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;((\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\land x\\notin F)\\to\\exists U,V\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,V)\\land x\\in U\\land F\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件采用不内含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span> 的 regular 定义；若采用“regular 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>”的约定，应在下游另加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span> 条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (拓扑空间谓词, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S$ (open set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S$ (closed set predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,x,F,U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5RegularSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}regular\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5RegularSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;((\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\land x\\notin F)\\to\\exists U,V\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,V)\\land x\\in U\\land F\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))","display":true},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false}],"bytes":1418,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3599","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space.md|58-df-zfc-top5-regular-space]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","473439958a92cf5b","4dc8b2d2e69010a2"]}